The '''Candy Talisman''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Accessory]] that increases the chance of obtaining {{LI|Green Candy}} and {{LI|Purple Candy}} during the [[Spooky Festival]] by 5%. It can be upgraded to the [[Candy Ring]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
The '''Candy Talisman''' can be purchased from the [[Fear Mongerer]], which is located on the [[Hub Island]] where the [[Event Stand]] is during the [[Spooky Festival]].
